From 78d46676558ea43e98ab0c2b42be070b6a057d3b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 13:19:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 18/19] uxtheme: Let a theme shrink image corners instead of
 cutting them.

An image drawn smaller than its sizing margins keeps its corners at full
size and cut. A theme with ScaleCorners = true in a [WineSizing] section
now gets its corners shrunk evenly, so round corners stay round on low
controls. Themes without it draw as before.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019oF8nnfMD8z5Z1MeNXoYS9
---
 dlls/uxtheme/draw.c     | 88 +++++++++++++++++++++++++----------------
 dlls/uxtheme/msstyles.c | 24 +++++++++++
 dlls/uxtheme/msstyles.h |  4 ++
 3 files changed, 83 insertions(+), 33 deletions(-)

diff --git a/dlls/uxtheme/draw.c b/dlls/uxtheme/draw.c
